PLR 3.1/3.3.2: a method reading fields of an instance of a class defined
later, through an unannotated (python_value) parameter. The 1a-bis re-pass
re-converts the method after the field-owning class struct is registered,
so the field reads resolve. Whole-group fix (not descriptor-specific).
